<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Module de révision — Séquence 2 — De la naissance de l'islam à la prise de Bagdad par les Mongols — 5e</title>
<style>
:root {
  --ink: #1c2733;
  --ink-soft: #4a5666;
  --paper: #faf8f4;
  --paper-raised: #ffffff;
  --line: #e2ded4;
  --accent: #1B5FA8;       /* Histoire */
  --accent-dark: #10314F;
  --accent-soft: #e8f0f9;
  --green: #1E8449;
  --orange: #E07B1D;
  --radius: 14px;
  --shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(28,39,51,.06), 0 6px 20px rgba(28,39,51,.05);
  --font: "Lexie Readable", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
body { margin: 0; font-family: var(--font); color: var(--ink); background: var(--paper); line-height: 1.5; }
.wrap { max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px; }

.module-header { background: var(--accent-dark); color: #fff; padding: 20px 0; }
.module-header .wrap { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.module-header .badge { width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: var(--accent); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.15rem; flex: none; }
.module-header h1 { font-size: 1.1rem; margin: 0; }
.module-header .sub { font-size: .8rem; opacity: .75; margin: 2px 0 0; }
.module-header .level-tag { margin-left: auto; background: var(--accent); color: #fff; font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 700; padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 999px; }

.tabs { display: flex; gap: 6px; background: var(--paper-raised); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); overflow-x: auto; position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 10; }
.tabs .wrap { display: flex; gap: 6px; padding-top: 8px; }
.tab-btn { border: none; background: transparent; font-family: var(--font); font-size: .9rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink-soft); padding: 12px 16px; cursor: pointer; border-bottom: 3px solid transparent; white-space: nowrap; }
.tab-btn:hover { color: var(--ink); }
.tab-btn.active { color: var(--accent); border-bottom-color: var(--accent); }

.panel { display: none; padding: 26px 0 60px; }
.panel.active { display: block; }

/* Dashboard */
.dash-hero { background: var(--accent-soft); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 24px; margin-bottom: 22px; }
.dash-hero .eyebrow { font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .04em; color: var(--accent); }
.dash-hero h2 { margin: 6px 0 8px; font-size: 1.35rem; }
.dash-hero p { margin: 0; color: var(--ink-soft); max-width: 62ch; }

.stat-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 22px; }
@media (max-width: 700px) { .stat-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
.stat-card { background: var(--paper-raised); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 16px 18px; }
.stat-card .label { font-size: .78rem; color: var(--ink-soft); font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.stat-card .value { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; }
.bar { height: 8px; background: var(--line); border-radius: 999px; overflow: hidden; margin-top: 8px; }
.bar > span { display: block; height: 100%; background: var(--accent); border-radius: 999px; transition: width .3s ease; }

.calendar-card { background: var(--paper-raised); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 22px; }
.calendar-card h3 { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: .95rem; }
.calendar-card p.desc { margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: .85rem; color: var(--ink-soft); }
.calendar-steps { display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.calendar-step { flex: 1; min-width: 90px; background: var(--accent-soft); border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px 8px; text-align: center; }
.calendar-step .tag { font-weight: 700; font-size: .82rem; color: var(--accent-dark); }
.calendar-step .date { font-size: .72rem; color: var(--ink-soft); margin-top: 2px; }

.reset-row { text-align: right; }
.reset-btn { font-family: var(--font); font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 700; color: #a34a2b; background: none; border: 1px solid #e0b294; border-radius: 10px; padding: 8px 14px; cursor: pointer; }
.reset-btn:hover { background: #fbe9e4; }

/* Flashcards */
.flash-wrap { max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto; }
.flash-meta { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: .8rem; color: var(--ink-soft); margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 700; }
.flash-card { perspective: 1200px; height: 300px; cursor: pointer; }
.flash-inner { position: relative; width: 100%; height: 100%; transition: transform .5s; transform-style: preserve-3d; }
.flash-inner.flipped { transform: rotateY(180deg); }
.flash-face { position: absolute; inset: 0; backface-visibility: hidden; border-radius: var(--radius); box-shadow: var(--shadow); padding: 26px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center; text-align: center; }
.flash-front { background: var(--accent-soft); }
.flash-front .theme { font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .04em; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 10px; }
.flash-front .q { font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); }
.flash-back { background: var(--accent-dark); color: #fff; transform: rotateY(180deg); }
.flash-back .a { font-size: 1rem; }
.flash-hint { font-size: .75rem; opacity: .65; margin-top: 14px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .04em; }

.flash-actions { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px; margin: 18px 0; }
.flash-actions button { font-family: var(--font); font-weight: 700; font-size: .84rem; padding: 13px 6px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--line); cursor: pointer; background: var(--paper-raised); }
.btn-revoir { color: #a34a2b; border-color: #e0b294; }
.btn-presque { color: var(--orange); border-color: #f0c894; }
.btn-sais { color: var(--green); border-color: #9bcbab; }

.flash-nav { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
.flash-nav button { font-family: var(--font); font-weight: 700; font-size: .85rem; background: none; border: none; color: var(--ink-soft); cursor: pointer; padding: 8px 10px; }
.flash-status { font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 700; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent-soft); color: var(--accent); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .03em; }
.flash-status.due { background: #fbe9e4; color: #a34a2b; }

/* QCM */
.qcm-card { background: var(--paper-raised); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 26px; }
.qcm-theme { font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .03em; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.qcm-q { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 18px; }
.qcm-options { display: grid; gap: 10px; }
.qcm-opt { text-align: left; font-family: var(--font); font-size: .92rem; padding: 13px 16px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1.5px solid var(--line); background: var(--paper); cursor: pointer; }
.qcm-opt:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }
.qcm-opt.correct { border-color: var(--green); background: #e7f3ec; font-weight: 700; }
.qcm-opt.wrong { border-color: #c0503a; background: #fbe9e4; font-weight: 700; }
.qcm-opt[disabled] { cursor: default; }
.qcm-explain { display: none; margin-top: 16px; background: var(--accent-soft); border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px 16px; font-size: .88rem; color: var(--ink); }
.qcm-explain.show { display: block; }
.qcm-footer { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-top: 20px; }
.qcm-footer button { font-family: var(--font); font-weight: 700; font-size: .88rem; padding: 12px 18px; border-radius: 10px; border: none; cursor: pointer; background: var(--accent-dark); color: #fff; }
.qcm-footer button:disabled { background: var(--line); color: var(--ink-soft); cursor: not-allowed; }
.qcm-footer .ghost { background: none; color: var(--ink-soft); }
.qcm-result { text-align: center; padding: 36px 20px; }
.qcm-result .score { font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); margin: 10px 0; }
.priority-list { text-align: left; max-width: 480px; margin: 18px auto 0; background: var(--accent-soft); border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px 18px; }
.priority-list h4 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: .85rem; }
.priority-list ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; font-size: .85rem; color: var(--ink-soft); }

/* Redaction */
.redac-select { display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 18px; }
.redac-select button { font-family: var(--font); font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 700; padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1.5px solid var(--line); background: var(--paper-raised); cursor: pointer; color: var(--ink-soft); }
.redac-select button.active { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); background: var(--accent-soft); }
.redac-select button.validated::after { content: " ✓"; color: var(--green); }
.redac-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 22px; align-items: start; }
@media (max-width: 800px) { .redac-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
.subject-card { background: var(--accent-dark); color: #fff; border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 22px; }
.subject-card .tag { font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .04em; background: rgba(255,255,255,.14); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 999px; }
.subject-card p.subject { font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.02rem; margin: 14px 0 10px; }
.subject-card p.consigne { font-size: .85rem; opacity: .85; margin: 0; }
.reveal-btn { margin-top: 14px; font-family: var(--font); font-weight: 700; font-size: .85rem; padding: 10px 16px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.5); background: transparent; color: #fff; cursor: pointer; }
.expected { display: none; margin-top: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.1); border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px 16px; font-size: .85rem; }
.expected.show { display: block; }

.checklist { background: var(--paper-raised); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 20px; margin-top: 16px; }
.checklist h3 { font-size: .95rem; margin: 0 0 12px; }
.checklist label { display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: flex-start; font-size: .85rem; color: var(--ink-soft); margin-bottom: 10px; cursor: pointer; }
.checklist input { margin-top: 3px; }

textarea.essay { width: 100%; min-height: 220px; font-family: var(--font); font-size: .92rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 16px; resize: vertical; background: var(--paper-raised); color: var(--ink); }
.essay-meta { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: .78rem; color: var(--ink-soft); margin-top: 8px; }

.filigrane-top { text-align: right; font-size: .68rem; font-style: italic; color: #b3b3b3; padding: 5px 20px; background: var(--paper); }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="filigrane-top">Séq. 2 : De la naissance de l'islam à la prise de Bagdad par les Mongols  ·  Module de révision</div>
<header class="module-header">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="badge">H</span>
    <div>
      <h1>De la naissance de l'islam à la prise de Bagdad par les Mongols</h1>
      <p class="sub">Module de révision interactif — Séquence 2 · Histoire · 5e</p>
    </div>
    <span class="level-tag">5e</span>
  </div>
</header>

<nav class="tabs">
  <div class="wrap">
    <button class="tab-btn active" data-tab="dashboard">Tableau de bord</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="flashcards">Flashcards</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="qcm">QCM</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="redac">Entraînement rédaction</button>
  </div>
</nav>

<main class="wrap">

  <!-- TABLEAU DE BORD -->
  <section class="panel active" id="panel-dashboard">
    <div class="dash-hero">
      <div class="eyebrow">Rappel actif</div>
      <h2>Prêt·e à réviser cette séquence ?</h2>
      <p>Ce module reprend les notions clés de la naissance de l'islam à la prise de Bagdad par les Mongols à travers des flashcards, un QCM et un entraînement à la rédaction. Ta progression est enregistrée sur cet appareil.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-grid">
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="label">Flashcards maîtrisées</div>
        <div class="value" id="dash-flash-text">0 / 20</div>
        <div class="bar"><span id="dash-flash-bar" style="width:0%"></span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="label">Meilleur score QCM</div>
        <div class="value" id="dash-qcm-text">Non tenté</div>
        <div class="bar"><span id="dash-qcm-bar" style="width:0%"></span></div>
